{"id": "60009", "title": "白璇珠", "author": "雅意", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60009.htm", "intro": "璇：次於玉的石头\r\n\r\n璇,美石次玉。──《说文》\r\n\r\n若不能用玉,可用白璇珠。──《晋书》\r\n\r\n文案\r\n\r\n绝望让我跳了下去，我以为我的死能逃避一切，可老天还是让我醒了过来，面对这不同的人生。\r\n\r\n醒来的我运气真是好啊！\r\n\r\n先是正直刚毅的十三王爷，\r\n\r\n再是超凡脱俗的绝色丞相，\r\n\r\n最後阴险狡诈的狐狸皇帝。\r\n\r\n一个平凡的女人不平凡的第二人生。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60009", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8782852.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8782854.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "8782856.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "8782858.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "8782861.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "8782863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8782864.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8782868.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-42", "file": "8782870.html", "available": false}]}